<Basic title="Sentence Game Rules" description="How to play the DessieOwO Sentence Game" canonical={new URL("https://www.dessieowo.com/applet/sentence-game/rules")}>
<article>
    <h1 style="text-align:center">How to play the DessieOwO Sentence Game.</h1>
    <h2>Original Version</h2>
    <ol>
        <li>Select one player to be the starter.</li>
        <li>The starter randomly generates a sentence using the <a href="/applet/sentence-game">Sentence Game Tool.</a></li>
        <li>The starter starts off a scene. The starter can not use the randomly generated sentence to start off.</li>
        <li>During the scene, the starter must use the sentence they generated.</li>
    </ol>
    <h2>Modified rules</h2>
    <p>You can also play using one or more of the following rules:</p>
    <ul>
        <li>All players have their own randomly generated sentence they must say.</li>
        <li>The starter must not reveal their sentence to the other players.</li>
        <li>The player says the random sentence first.</li>
    </ul>
</article>
</Basic>